WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.382 --> 00:00:04.765
Unit nineteen. Renewable Energy Transition!

2
00:00:05.732 --> 00:00:14.154
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Upper-Intermediate level!

3
00:00:14.204 --> 00:00:17.418
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:17.468 --> 00:00:21.992
Today we learn: Renewable Energy Transition. Let's go!

5
00:00:23.111 --> 00:00:28.178
Energy transition. Say it with me. Energy transition!

6
00:00:31.666 --> 00:00:37.766
Fossil fuel dependency. Say it with me. Fossil fuel dependency!

7
00:00:41.258 --> 00:00:46.808
Solar infrastructure. Say it with me. Solar infrastructure!

8
00:00:50.319 --> 00:00:54.686
Carbon neutral. Say it with me. Carbon neutral!

9
00:00:58.172 --> 00:01:02.388
Investment. Say it with me. Investment!

10
00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:10.760
Grid modernization. Say it with me. Grid modernization!

11
00:01:14.293 --> 00:01:19.509
Policy incentive. Say it with me. Policy incentive!

12
00:01:22.971 --> 00:01:27.821
Sustainability. Say it with me. Sustainability!

13
00:01:31.361 --> 00:01:42.365
Grammar time! Conditional (if or unless). Listen. Unless we invest now, the energy transition will be delayed.

14
00:01:42.415 --> 00:01:49.684
Your turn. Say it with me. Unless we invest now, the energy transition will be delayed.

15
00:01:54.926 --> 00:02:13.240
Moving away from fossil fuel dependency requires a major energy transition toward solar infrastructure and grid modernization. Achieving a carbon neutral future depends on strong investment and policy incentives that support long-term sustainability.

16
00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:14.943
I like this story!

17
00:02:15.803 --> 00:02:21.003
Look! What's the word?

18
00:02:21.053 --> 00:02:22.856
Solar infrastructure!

19
00:02:23.959 --> 00:02:29.208
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:29.258 --> 00:02:30.947
Policy incentive!

21
00:02:32.239 --> 00:02:43.199
Think and answer. What incentive might encourage more people to switch to renewable energy?

22
00:02:43.249 --> 00:02:44.511
Great answer!

23
00:02:45.495 --> 00:02:49.595
This unit's value is Environmental Stewardship.

24
00:02:49.645 --> 00:02:53.712
I can show environmental stewardship every day!

25
00:02:54.657 --> 00:03:03.050
Congratulations, everyone! You finished the Upper-Intermediate level. See you in Advanced. Goodbye!

26
00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:06.983
Thank you, Teacher Chanthy! See you in Advanced!

